'''Thirukkalvanur''' also known as 'Aadhivaraaha Perumal Temple' is a Vaishnavite temple in [[Kanchipuram]], [[Tamil Nadu]] state in [[India]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=Sri Aadhi Varaha Perumal Temple - 108 Divya Desam |url=https://templefolks.com/temple-pedia/sri-aadhi-varaha-perumal-temple-thirukkalvanoor |access-date=2024-09-07 |website=Templefolks |language=EN}}</ref> It is one of the [[108 Divya desams]]. It is situated right to the Kamakshi Amman shrine in Kanchipuram.<ref>{{Cite web |title=Indian Heritage - Temples - 108 Divya Desams - Thirukkallvanur (Kancheepuram) |url=https://www.indian-heritage.org/temple/divyadesams/divya54.html |access-date=2024-09-07 |website=www.indian-heritage.org}}</ref>

